c stealth kills with an on-screen kanji splash | **Silent Cuts**: 5 directions (back, side, unaware front, from above, from the water), different for each character, with slow motion, a zoom and a red brush splash of **静斬** (\"silent cut\", an original choice; not the source's kanji) |\n| Grappling hook to rooftops | **Kaginawa**: the only way onto roofs. Auto-target, an aim mode, and mouse targeting |\n| Ninja tools carried into missions; items chosen before each mission | **The Bento**: 8 compartments (2 tiers × 4) packed on a \"Pack the Bento\" screen. Food tools (rice balls, poisoned rice, sleep dango, sour plum) and steel tools (shuriken, smoke, caltrops, firecracker, fire pot, straw cloak) |\n| Poisoned rice that guards eat | The **Poison Rice Ball**, the game's signature lunchbox item; hungry guards complain about garrison rice |\n| Ranks after each mission from kills and times spotted; high ranks unlock gadgets | Results scroll with a hanko rank stamp","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_019FXWMVmrS3mqW2WiYfL5ZM","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
