{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says (TASK.md describes the game). Done when: the bundled single .html file exists in this folder's root, every feature in TASK.md is implemented with no TODOs, placeholders or stubs, exit-interview.json in this folder's root parses as JSON and answers every field, and your final reply contains the Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections.]: Not satisfied per transcript. The final message admits the Silent Cut animations are not per-character/per-kind: \"Silent Cuts differ per character and kind in sound, sparks and splash, but all reuse the engine's takedown body animation. No new animation clips.\" TASK/PLAN call for new animations for what makes the source feel distinctive, and PLAN section 5.7 specifies per-character, per-kind cut animations. Also, the AI Hub harness was not re-run after the final changes (\"I did not re-run the AI Hub harness after these changes\"), so the hub requirement is not confirmed against the final build. The bundled HTML, exit-interview.json (parsed as JSON in transcript) and the four required sections are present."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"43afccef-313a-4676-88e8-afa636ccfdd6","uuid":"377aceeb-3fe5-4220-93e6-7587e6afe737","timestamp":"2026-11-04T02:03:09.720Z","isSynthetic":true}
